WEBVTT

00:00:11.268 --> 00:00:13.270
It's been three days now.

00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:16.857
Michel Lemon! Out.

00:00:23.364 --> 00:00:24.865
Bardet.

00:00:25.074 --> 00:00:26.951
I 've been looking for you, man.

00:01:59.543 --> 00:02:03.380
" Episode 7
Giant Killing "

00:02:03.839 --> 00:02:07.843
lt's a shame about Mr. Lemon.
He's been in jail all this time.

00:02:08.052 --> 00:02:10.763
He's a hostage.
He'll just have to put up with it.

00:02:10.971 --> 00:02:12.222
I suppose.

00:02:13.265 --> 00:02:16.352
Will this work for
the fire control system settings?

00:02:18.395 --> 00:02:19.730
You did these?

00:02:19.938 --> 00:02:23.442
I 'm not good with stuff like this. ls it okay?

00:02:23.651 --> 00:02:24.526
It's flawless.

00:02:24.735 --> 00:02:28.322
Oh, good! This took a whole half a day.

00:02:28.530 --> 00:02:30.115
I wasn 't too confident.

00:02:30.324 --> 00:02:34.703
This work takes three days even for experts.
Where did you learn it?

00:02:34.912 --> 00:02:36.997
Well, l mean, l just know how.

00:02:37.206 --> 00:02:38.624
That's impossible.

00:02:38.832 --> 00:02:41.043
Who in the world taught you a skill <i>like...</i>

00:02:43.962 --> 00:02:45.464
What's wrong?

00:02:45.673 --> 00:02:48.759
Nami. You might be...

00:02:48.967 --> 00:02:50.511
No, never mind.

00:02:50.719 --> 00:02:55.099
There's no way she's the same
as Chidori and Tessa.

00:02:55.307 --> 00:02:56.767
Weirdo.

00:03:06.235 --> 00:03:10.197
This is takin ' forever.
Are you sure this is the place?

00:03:10.406 --> 00:03:12.700
Assuming this map isn 't wrong, yeah.

00:03:12.908 --> 00:03:18.497
I figured we'd be led to some
dangerous locale for an illegal battle.

00:03:18.706 --> 00:03:20.416
This is just the boonies.

00:03:20.624 --> 00:03:25.003
There are old ruins over there.
l figure they probably use those?

00:03:29.174 --> 00:03:30.718
Looks like they' re <i>here.</i>

00:03:40.519 --> 00:03:42.396
Sousuke Sagara.

00:03:42.604 --> 00:03:45.315
You 'll board your mech <i>here.</i>

00:03:45.524 --> 00:03:50.404
There are ruins 3km to the northwest.
Move there and stand by.

00:03:50.612 --> 00:03:51.739
What about us?

00:03:51.947 --> 00:03:53.198
Stay <i>here.</i>

00:03:53.407 --> 00:03:57.286
Huh?! Wireless instructions
won't reach from that far away!

00:03:57.494 --> 00:03:58.412
What do--

00:03:58.620 --> 00:04:01.039
It's for safety's sake, young lady.

00:04:01.248 --> 00:04:04.418
One stray bullet means a horrible tragedy.

00:04:04.626 --> 00:04:07.796
A-A splendid order, sir.

00:04:09.548 --> 00:04:11.008
What about AS weapons?

00:04:11.216 --> 00:04:13.719
They've been placed at the ruins.

00:04:15.304 --> 00:04:16.847
Oh, yes.

00:04:17.055 --> 00:04:22.019
About your opponent tonight.
We've prepared an interesting mech.

00:04:22.227 --> 00:04:24.188
By all means, have fun.

00:04:41.747 --> 00:04:42.873
All right, l ' ll be back.

00:04:43.081 --> 00:04:44.249
Be careful!

00:04:44.458 --> 00:04:45.250
Don 't worry.

00:04:45.459 --> 00:04:48.170
I 'm worried about the mech, not you!

00:04:48.378 --> 00:04:49.755
Oh.

00:04:49.963 --> 00:04:51.256
But...

00:04:54.885 --> 00:04:58.013
S-Still, don't do anything reckless.

00:04:58.222 --> 00:05:01.391
You 'd better come back in one piece!

00:05:01.600 --> 00:05:03.143
I intend to.

00:05:06.396 --> 00:05:08.148
Good, then.

00:05:08.357 --> 00:05:10.651
You owe me dinner once this is over!

00:05:15.948 --> 00:05:17.241
Sousuke?

00:05:18.700 --> 00:05:20.285
What's wrong?

00:05:20.494 --> 00:05:21.829
Are you listening?

00:05:22.037 --> 00:05:24.206
Sure. l 'll treat you to anything.

00:05:24.414 --> 00:05:25.499
<i>See</i> you later.

00:05:28.710 --> 00:05:29.670
Sousuke...

00:05:29.878 --> 00:05:32.673
Don 't worry. He can take care of himself.

00:05:32.881 --> 00:05:37.511
And l have a feeling
<i>we 're</i> the ones in trouble.

00:06:08.500 --> 00:06:10.168
I got started without you.

00:06:10.377 --> 00:06:14.756
Oh, M r. Kurama. You 've arrived early.

00:06:14.965 --> 00:06:18.719
I don 't like doing things
this slowly and tediously, though.

00:06:18.927 --> 00:06:20.554
But it must be this way.

00:06:20.762 --> 00:06:25.517
Executives all around the globe
are planning to watch this battle.

00:06:25.726 --> 00:06:27.019
It's stupid.

00:06:29.146 --> 00:06:30.355
Excuse <i>me.</i>

00:06:30.564 --> 00:06:34.568
Help yourself, if you wish.
They're of the finest quality.

00:06:34.776 --> 00:06:36.320
Stop it.

00:06:38.280 --> 00:06:40.282
I quit smoking.

00:07:08.477 --> 00:07:11.688
Welcome to the true arena, Crossbow.

00:07:11.897 --> 00:07:16.234
Over there you ' ll find your weapons.
Use them as you <i>see</i> fit.

00:07:17.694 --> 00:07:19.363
I appreciate that.

00:07:41.343 --> 00:07:47.182
That won 't work. lt's set up so
this viewing area can 't be attacked.

00:07:47.391 --> 00:07:48.684
That figures.

00:07:52.479 --> 00:07:54.856
So where's my opponent for tonight?

00:07:55.065 --> 00:07:58.694
Right there. The operator
has a smile on his face.

00:08:05.158 --> 00:08:06.410
I smell ozone!

00:08:19.339 --> 00:08:21.174
Have you figured it out?

00:08:21.383 --> 00:08:23.176
This mech is...

00:08:26.847 --> 00:08:28.765
...an M9, of all things.

00:08:28.974 --> 00:08:30.642
Surprised?

00:08:30.851 --> 00:08:35.522
Prom what l hear, you used to
pilot that mech all the time.

00:08:35.731 --> 00:08:38.442
That is, when you were with
Mithril or whatever it's called.

00:08:38.650 --> 00:08:41.028
Sounds like you have it all figured out.

00:08:41.236 --> 00:08:45.699
Sure, when you attracted all that attention
and didn 't even use an alias.

00:08:45.907 --> 00:08:48.702
I 'd have been fine with
getting rid of you downtown,

00:08:48.910 --> 00:08:50.912
but that would have been boring.

00:08:51.121 --> 00:08:55.584
I decided, since it's here,
l 'll have you fight that M9.

00:08:55.792 --> 00:08:57.419
So it was Amalgam 's idea?

00:08:57.627 --> 00:09:00.547
I might just tell you, if you survive.

00:09:00.756 --> 00:09:06.636
But how will you stand up
to a cutting-edge mech using that heap?

00:09:06.845 --> 00:09:09.723
In other words, this isn 't a fighting match.

00:09:10.974 --> 00:09:12.684
It's an execution.

00:09:15.270 --> 00:09:16.354
Do it.

00:09:36.708 --> 00:09:38.085
As quick as <i>ever.</i>

00:10:07.364 --> 00:10:09.032
No way, an M9?

00:10:09.241 --> 00:10:13.703
Say what? That's state-of-the-art! Not even
the US military has fielded those yet!

00:10:13.912 --> 00:10:16.915
But... l ' m sure of it. That's an M9.

00:10:17.124 --> 00:10:19.793
--Whoa, whoa! Ours is a Savage!
--Ah, shit...

00:10:20.001 --> 00:10:23.004
That's like racing a Porsche with a mini truck!

00:10:23.213 --> 00:10:24.673
We don 't stand a chance!

00:10:24.881 --> 00:10:28.760
Hey! Even if it's an illegal battle,
isn 't this a little much?!

00:10:28.969 --> 00:10:31.304
Cancel the match right now!

00:10:33.557 --> 00:10:37.477
Yes, sir. Yes, sir. Understood.

00:10:37.686 --> 00:10:38.895
Hey!

00:10:39.104 --> 00:10:40.856
We' re relocating! Get in.

00:10:41.064 --> 00:10:42.816
W-Wait! What the--

00:10:43.024 --> 00:10:44.484
Hurry up!

00:10:44.693 --> 00:10:46.570
That hurt...

00:10:53.660 --> 00:10:54.578
You, come this way.

00:10:54.786 --> 00:10:57.122
--Hey!
--Nami!

00:10:57.330 --> 00:11:00.625
Don 't worry. l ' ll get in touch later.

00:11:00.834 --> 00:11:02.377
Ouit wasting time.

00:11:12.304 --> 00:11:15.015
He's doing well in that junker.

00:11:15.223 --> 00:11:17.475
Between those skills and the Arbalest,

00:11:17.684 --> 00:11:19.019
no wonder he gave us so much trouble.

00:11:19.227 --> 00:11:20.770
Arbalest?

00:11:20.979 --> 00:11:24.357
Never mind. l 'm saying we can 't be too careful.

00:11:24.566 --> 00:11:30.280
Well, to me, he just looked like
a typical has-been child soldier.

00:11:30.488 --> 00:11:32.115
Don 't underestimate him.

00:11:32.324 --> 00:11:34.743
He's the man who killed
the likes of Gauron and Gates.

00:11:34.951 --> 00:11:36.828
Gauron? Gates?

00:11:37.037 --> 00:11:38.288
You don 't know of them?

00:11:38.496 --> 00:11:39.331
No.

00:11:39.539 --> 00:11:41.625
It's so carefree out in the country.

00:11:41.833 --> 00:11:42.792
Sir?

00:11:43.001 --> 00:11:43.793
Don 't worry about it.

00:11:44.002 --> 00:11:45.462
Yes, sir...

00:11:47.714 --> 00:11:52.093
Th-That aside, we're planning on
getting rid of Sagara 's buddies.

00:11:52.302 --> 00:11:54.554
Would you care to watch?

00:11:54.763 --> 00:11:56.264
Not interested.

00:12:10.487 --> 00:12:12.364
I 'll never win in a gunfight.

00:12:25.210 --> 00:12:28.505
H-Hey! Why' re we going
in different directions?

00:12:28.713 --> 00:12:30.966
You guys don 't need to know.

00:12:41.601 --> 00:12:42.936
Get out.

00:12:43.144 --> 00:12:45.647
All right, you don 't have to push.

00:12:50.944 --> 00:12:52.779
This is...

00:12:52.988 --> 00:12:54.990
A pig farm.

00:13:11.339 --> 00:13:13.133
Line up and climb the stairs.

00:13:13.341 --> 00:13:17.137
Y-You 're kidding, right?
Any way you look at it, this's--

00:13:18.430 --> 00:13:20.265
Don 't give us any trouble!

00:13:20.473 --> 00:13:21.474
Are you serious?

00:13:21.683 --> 00:13:23.226
Just let us go.

00:13:23.435 --> 00:13:27.063
Sorry, but l have my orders.
Line up like l said.

00:13:27.272 --> 00:13:29.190
There's no need for that.

00:13:31.693 --> 00:13:36.031
L-Lemon! Y-You 're supposed to be in jail!

00:13:36.239 --> 00:13:39.242
Never mind, just get down low.

00:13:39.451 --> 00:13:43.121
I don 't know what the deal is,
but you have the nerve to show up here?

00:13:43.330 --> 00:13:46.082
I guess we'll feed you to the pigs, too!

00:13:46.291 --> 00:13:48.126
I 'll pass.

00:13:48.335 --> 00:13:49.336
Kill them.

00:13:56.468 --> 00:13:58.553
The situation's under control, monsieur.

00:13:58.762 --> 00:14:00.555
Thanks, Bardet.

00:14:01.890 --> 00:14:03.892
Lemon, what's going on here?

00:14:04.100 --> 00:14:06.853
It's basically what it looks like.

00:14:07.062 --> 00:14:11.691
I 'm not really a journalist.
These guys are my colleagues.

00:14:11.900 --> 00:14:14.361
Although l can 't fill you in on the details.

00:14:16.905 --> 00:14:19.949
Sounds like Sousuke is
getting close to his objective.

00:14:20.158 --> 00:14:22.952
Probably the same objective as mine.

00:14:24.829 --> 00:14:26.623
My last magazine...

00:14:36.841 --> 00:14:38.468
He's ready to end this.

00:15:05.495 --> 00:15:08.748
Not much ammo left.
And only two more HEAT Hammers.

00:15:14.587 --> 00:15:16.005
Might as well risk it.

00:15:49.080 --> 00:15:51.499
A little farther forward, that's right.

00:16:26.576 --> 00:16:28.620
A-A draw?

00:16:28.828 --> 00:16:31.831
That was no accident--it was intentional.

00:16:32.040 --> 00:16:34.709
The M9 is fully electrically driven.

00:16:34.918 --> 00:16:38.796
If it's hit by an excessive load,
it won 't be able to move properly.

00:16:39.005 --> 00:16:41.090
But while the Savage is an old mech,

00:16:41.299 --> 00:16:44.469
its oval torso makes it
durable against pressure.

00:16:44.677 --> 00:16:47.555
And it also uses a hydraulic drive.

00:16:47.764 --> 00:16:49.724
Even if it's crushed by
a large amount of rubble,

00:16:49.933 --> 00:16:52.852
a Savage can escape using its own power.

00:16:58.399 --> 00:16:59.817
What a good mech.

00:17:19.837 --> 00:17:21.714
He ended up winning.

00:17:21.923 --> 00:17:25.385
Impossible... Who <i>is he...?</i> lmpossible!

00:17:25.593 --> 00:17:27.887
So what's your plan now?

00:17:28.763 --> 00:17:34.143
He found out who we are.
He'll do whatever he has to to get to you.

00:17:36.563 --> 00:17:38.356
E-Enter!

00:17:38.565 --> 00:17:39.983
I beg your pardon, sir.

00:17:44.779 --> 00:17:48.741
Right, that's right! l still have you!

00:17:52.996 --> 00:17:57.959
Who the hell are you,
that you took down this M9?

00:17:58.167 --> 00:18:02.255
I 'm the one asking the questions.
ldentify yourself to <i>me.</i>

00:18:02.463 --> 00:18:03.881
I refuse.

00:18:05.174 --> 00:18:08.219
That combat with you wore
this thing out quite a bit.

00:18:08.428 --> 00:18:10.346
I might end up crushing you.

00:18:10.555 --> 00:18:11.848
Stop!

00:18:12.890 --> 00:18:17.061
I bet it's hot. This mech's
cooling system is shoddy.

00:18:17.270 --> 00:18:19.689
The heat travels all the way
down to the fingertips.

00:18:19.897 --> 00:18:21.316
All right! All right!

00:18:21.524 --> 00:18:23.568
I surrender! Let go!

00:18:25.320 --> 00:18:27.530
State your name and affiliation.

00:18:27.739 --> 00:18:29.616
George Lovelock.

00:18:29.824 --> 00:18:33.119
I 'm currently with Amalgam 's aggressor force.

00:18:33.328 --> 00:18:35.955
Were you previously a Mithril soldier?

00:18:36.164 --> 00:18:37.707
That's right.

00:18:37.915 --> 00:18:40.168
Wait, don 't tell me you <i>'re...</i>

00:18:40.376 --> 00:18:43.004
l was with the West Pacific Pleet.

00:18:43.212 --> 00:18:47.258
No wonder you 're familiar with
the M9's weaknesses.

00:18:47.467 --> 00:18:49.677
I was with the Mediterranean Pleet.

00:18:49.886 --> 00:18:52.138
What happened to your forces?

00:18:52.347 --> 00:18:56.225
They were wiped out while l was
away from base on a mission.

00:18:56.434 --> 00:19:00.521
When l returned, little did l
know it was under <i>their</i> control.

00:19:00.730 --> 00:19:02.774
And so, you surrendered.

00:19:02.982 --> 00:19:05.777
It's better than dying in vain.

00:19:05.985 --> 00:19:08.071
Where are their bases of operation?

00:19:08.279 --> 00:19:09.989
I 'm not too sure.

00:19:10.198 --> 00:19:12.533
What l actually saw was a camp
on the outskirts of Tripoli,

00:19:12.742 --> 00:19:14.869
and some place on Ceylon.

00:19:15.078 --> 00:19:17.205
I only just got here yesterday.

00:19:17.413 --> 00:19:19.499
A man calling himself Kurama showed up.

00:19:19.707 --> 00:19:21.125
You said Kurama?

00:19:21.334 --> 00:19:22.669
You know him?

00:19:22.877 --> 00:19:24.337
Where is he?

00:19:24.545 --> 00:19:26.297
At that viewing area.

00:19:27.924 --> 00:19:29.342
Kurama...

00:19:34.180 --> 00:19:35.223
A chopper's coming!

00:19:35.431 --> 00:19:39.227
Must be to finish us both off.
We' re done for.

00:19:39.435 --> 00:19:40.478
Hide somewhere.

00:19:40.687 --> 00:19:42.939
Aren 't you out of weapons?

00:19:43.147 --> 00:19:44.232
No problem.

00:19:49.362 --> 00:19:50.363
Whoa...

00:19:51.364 --> 00:19:52.490
You can 't mean...!

00:20:25.106 --> 00:20:26.858
Everything has its limit.

00:20:27.900 --> 00:20:29.485
Is it inoperative?

00:20:31.154 --> 00:20:34.741
It' ll run with a few repairs,
but for now it's stuck.

00:20:34.949 --> 00:20:37.201
There's no time. Go on and make a run for it.

00:20:37.410 --> 00:20:41.998
Don 't tell me you 're fighting
all by yourself? Against Amalgam?!

00:20:44.292 --> 00:20:45.585
Affirmative.

00:20:47.003 --> 00:20:50.339
You 're insane. You 'll get killed!

00:20:50.548 --> 00:20:53.718
They took something precious from <i>me.</i>

00:20:53.926 --> 00:20:56.304
I intend to get it back no matter what.

00:20:58.848 --> 00:21:02.685
I don 't get it. You and l are just mercenaries.

00:21:03.686 --> 00:21:05.772
I 'm no longer a mercenary.

00:21:05.980 --> 00:21:07.315
I 'm just a man.

00:21:17.325 --> 00:21:18.659
Damn it!

00:21:26.459 --> 00:21:28.419
Apparently, it's all over.

00:21:28.628 --> 00:21:30.922
I heard it was a big upset.

00:21:31.130 --> 00:21:34.175
I bet a lot of guys are getting
ready to skip town tonight.

00:21:39.847 --> 00:21:41.307
Security's tight.

00:21:46.062 --> 00:21:47.146
Nami!

00:21:51.192 --> 00:21:53.152
Sagara! Are you watching?!

00:21:53.361 --> 00:21:55.446
I know you ' re there!

00:21:55.655 --> 00:22:00.785
Come out and drop your weapons!
Otherwise, l 'll kill this girl!

00:22:02.870 --> 00:22:05.164
You remember what happened in Tokyo, right?

00:22:05.373 --> 00:22:07.917
I think you know l 'm serious.

00:22:09.919 --> 00:22:10.878
Too far away.

00:22:11.087 --> 00:22:13.172
I 'll give you ten seconds!

00:22:14.173 --> 00:22:15.341
Ten!

00:22:16.676 --> 00:22:18.302
Nine!

00:22:18.511 --> 00:22:19.971
So many <i>enemies...</i>

00:22:20.179 --> 00:22:21.430
Eight!

00:22:23.391 --> 00:22:24.725
Seven!

00:22:28.938 --> 00:22:30.147
Six!

00:22:31.774 --> 00:22:33.025
Pive!

00:22:33.234 --> 00:22:34.527
Chidori!

00:24:06.077 --> 00:24:07.578
" Episode 8
One-Man Porce "

00:24:07.578 --> 00:24:09.789
